    {
      "id": "t1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Set up user authentication\n\nImplement login and registration flows using JWT tokens.\n\n- POST /auth/login → returns access + refresh token\n- POST /auth/register → creates user, sends verification email\n- POST /auth/refresh → rotates tokens",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Build password reset flow\n\nAllow users to reset their password via email link.\n\nAcceptance: user receives a reset email within 60 seconds\nAcceptance: reset link expires after 1 hour\nAcceptance: using the link invalidates all existing sessions",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Add OAuth login (GitHub + Google)\n\nAllow users to sign in with their existing GitHub or Google accounts.\n\n- Redirect to provider → exchange code → upsert user record\n- Link OAuth identity to existing email account when matched",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "g-sprint-2",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Sprint 2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 440
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Design dashboard home screen\n\nCreate the main dashboard layout shown after login.\n\n- Widget grid with drag-and-drop reordering\n- Persistent layout saved per user\n- Empty state when no widgets are added",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Implement activity feed widget\n\nShow a chronological list of recent events on the dashboard.\n\nAcceptance: feed loads in under 500 ms\nAcceptance: new events appear without a full page reload\nAcceptance: user can mark individual events as read",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Explore push notification support\n\nInvestigate Web Push API and service-worker requirements.\n\n- Compare browser support matrix\n- Prototype opt-in permission flow\n- Estimate backend changes needed",
